  storyLines:
  - 'Mysterious voice: I''m glad you decided to play my game.'
  - "Given the weather outside, I suppose you don\u2019t really have anything better
    to do."
  - 'But, still, you made the right choice. '
  - 'One of few.  '
  - "Mysterious voice: On the right, you\u2019ll see some options. "
  - 'You can end your turn right now. '
  - " Of course, that\u2019d be awfully silly given you haven\u2019t played any cards.  "
  - You can also draw a card.
  - One per turn.
  - I recommend you remember that.
  - Below the draw button, you should see a number
  - This number is a currency of sorts.
  - "We\u2019ll call them\u2026 \u2018sapling\u2019 points."
  - Every card you place with this sigil requires a certain amount of this currency.
  - 'I recommend you spend it wisely.  '
  - There is one type of card in your deck that bears a different sigil.
  - "Unlike sapling cards, the currency for these \u2018industry\u2019 cards"
  - is death.
  - 'Each industry card requires you sacrifice a certain number '
  - of the nature cards, placed on your side of the board, in order to play them.
  - But be careful.
  - Although these cards are more powerful, their power comes at a cost...
